  "body": "Hi,\r\n\r\nSilvio stopped to maintain docker-matrix. We (https://github.com/AVENTER-UG/docker-matrix) took it over. It would be nice if you can update the link in your readme to the new docker repository: https://hub.docker.com/r/avhost/docker-matrix/tags/\r\n\r\nWe done some changes. First, we changed to the smaller \"debian:stretch-slim\" and second, like u see, we are using tags for our docker images. In a production environment is it very necessary. :-)\r\n\r\nTo be sure that we maintain the image, you can verify it via a issue in silvios repo. I will give you a answer there. :-)\r\n\r\nHave a nice day,\r\nAndreas",
